#: main.cpp:30
msgid "Recipients Picker Demo"
msgstr "Adressatenköör-Demo"

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "(c) 2007"
msgstr "(c) 2007"

#: mainwindow.cpp:74
msgid "Select recipient"
msgstr "Adressaat kören"

#: mainwindow.cpp:79 mainwindow.cpp:221
msgid "Advanced Interface"
msgstr "Verwiedert Koppelsteed"

#: mainwindow.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Toggles between a simple interface to add one or more persons as recipient "
"or an advanced interface with more possibilities which are not required so "
"often."
msgstr ""
"Wesselt twischen en eenfach Koppelsteed för't Tofögen vun Adressaten na en "
"verwiedert Koppelsteed mit mehr Mööglichkeiten, de man nich so faken bruukt "
"warrt."

#: mainwindow.cpp:93
msgid "This list displays persons who are filtered with the settings above."
msgstr "Disse List wiest de Lüüd, de mit de Instellen baven filtert warrt."

#: mainwindow.cpp:106
msgid "Marked persons only "
msgstr "Bloots markeerte Lüüd"

#: mainwindow.cpp:107
msgid "Show only persons who are marked with a status"
msgstr "Bloots de mit en Status markeerten Lüüd wiesen."

#: mainwindow.cpp:113
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Söken"

#: mainwindow.cpp:114
msgid ""
"Enter a text to filter the persons in the list. You can also enter "
"informations which are not visible in the list like addresses or phone "
"numbers"
msgstr ""
"Giff en Text för't Filtern vun de oplisten Personen in. Du kannst ok "
"Informatschonen ingeven, de in de List nich sichtbor sünd, a.B. Adressen "
"oder Telefoonnummern."

#: mainwindow.cpp:119
msgid " Address book:"
msgstr "Adressbook:"

#: mainwindow.cpp:124 mainwindow.cpp:245
msgid "All"
msgstr "All"

#: mainwindow.cpp:125 mainwindow.cpp:246
msgid "Distribution Lists"
msgstr "Verdeellisten"

#: mainwindow.cpp:126
msgid "Select a address book or a category to display those persons only"
msgstr ""
"Söök en Adressbook oder en Kategorie ut, wenn Du bloots disse Lüüd wiesen "
"wullt."

#: mainwindow.cpp:163
msgid "Do not show every recipient to the other ones"
msgstr "Nich all Adressaten de anner Adressaten wiesen"

#: mainwindow.cpp:164
msgid "Display all recipients to each one"
msgstr "All Adressaten de anner Adressaten wiesen"

#: mainwindow.cpp:223
msgid "Basic Interface"
msgstr "Eenfach Koppelsteed"

#: mainwindow.cpp:247
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategorie"

#: persontreeview.cpp:198
msgid ""
"You do not have any persons in your addressbook. You can insert persons with "
"the programm kadressbook which is also part of the kdepim package."
msgstr ""
"Dien Adressbook bargt keen Lüüd. Lüüd laat sik mit dat Programm \"KAdressbook"
"\" infögen, dat ok Deel vun't Paket \"kdepim\" is."

